{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ravengrave: Iron Bonds",
    "steam_appid": 3513720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravengrave: Iron Bonds</strong> immerses you in the life of a young Viking who must take over the family forge to pay off a debt that threatens to destroy everything. Face the pressure of time and the management of orders that will test your ability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge with precision:</strong> Master an interactive forging system where accuracy matters. You\u2019ll control the smelting and shaping of items using only the mouse, managing temperature and avoiding material loss to maximize the value of each piece. Every well-forged tool can mean the difference between success and ruin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management and trade:</strong> Handle resources, balance costs, upgrade your equipment, and meet customer demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep narrative:</strong> Uncover the story behind your father\u2019s debt while tending to the village\u2019s needs. Witness changes in the community as growing tensions and hidden secrets slowly come to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic survival:</strong> Choose between completing main quests, fulfilling side orders, or mass selling to keep the business afloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay that\u2019s accessible yet challenging, <strong>Ravengrave: Iron Bonds</strong> offers an immersive forging and survival experience. <br><br>Will you forge your own destiny, or succumb to the weight of debt?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ravengrave: Iron Bonds</strong> immerses you in the life of a young Viking who must take over the family forge to pay off a debt that threatens to destroy everything. Face the pressure of time and the management of orders that will test your ability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge with precision:</strong> Master an interactive forging system where accuracy matters. You\u2019ll control the smelting and shaping of items using only the mouse, managing temperature and avoiding material loss to maximize the value of each piece. Every well-forged tool can mean the difference between success and ruin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management and trade:</strong> Handle resources, balance costs, upgrade your equipment, and meet customer demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep narrative:</strong> Uncover the story behind your father\u2019s debt while tending to the village\u2019s needs. Witness changes in the community as growing tensions and hidden secrets slowly come to light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic survival:</strong> Choose between completing main quests, fulfilling side orders, or mass selling to keep the business afloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With gameplay that\u2019s accessible yet challenging, <strong>Ravengrave: Iron Bonds</strong> offers an immersive forging and survival experience. <br><br>Will you forge your own destiny, or succumb to the weight of debt?</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019re a young viking when your world falls apart: your father has fled, leaving you behind with the blacksmith... and a crushing debt. You must master blacksmithing from scratch to survive. Will you rise to the challenge and forge your own path, or will the pressure break you first?",
